      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "beat": 4
      },
      "text": "And: structure is chosen in advance and tested in arrears \u2014 you draw the chart when you are small and\noptimistic; it is read aloud when you are large and adversarial, by a lawyer you did not hire.",
      "fontSize": 16,
